<title>USA: TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Oklahoma 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $164,250 IGA Tennis Classic on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>3-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Tami Whitlinger Jones (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Maria Alejandra Vento (Venezuela) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>7-Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat Nana Miyhagi (Japan) 4-6 3-5 retired</p>
<p>Pam Shriver (U.S.) beat 8-Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 7-5 6-7 (4-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Kyoko Nagatsuka (Japan) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-4 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Sandra Cacic (U.S.) beat Katrina Adams (U.S.) 7-6 (7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Alexia Dechaume Ballert (France) beat Ginger Helgeson Nielsen (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Meilen Tu (U.S.) beat Angelica Gavaldon (Mexico) 6-2 2-6 7-5</p>
<p>Magdalena Gryzbowska (Poland) beat Elena Brioukhovets (Ukraine) 7-6 (7-1) 3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
